  "project_description": "Description \n This module allows you to use animated GIFs on your site.\n\n If the mime-type of the file is image/gif, the image formatter will ignore the image styles and renders the original GIF.\n\n Use this with caution! There are no image styles applied, so the image dimensions will not be changed and can break your styling!\n\n Maintainers \n \n Stijn Stroobants (StijnStroobants) \n Florent Torregrosa (Grimreaper) \n Back to top",
